    "title": "Private customer business draft creation",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Local/test customer draft generation over existing core identity/portfolio. Immutable private revisions; draft_ready is a business proposition and website draft, not public deployment/F1 acceptance. HTML content requires a sandboxed iframe without scripts/same-origin/forms/navigation/network. Request bodies bounded16KiB. Existing v1 auth, intake and operator contracts unchanged."
